@@ -30,0 +31,11 @@
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN BEHAVIOR -->
+### Behavior
+
+On branches with the manual Porter/Ioniq selector, choosing a vehicle in comma Toggles saves a steering ratio of 20.2 for Porter II EV or 14.0 for Ioniq 5 HDA2. Porter automatic SET, low-speed cancellation and dedicated GAP toggles and other manual settings are preserved.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END BEHAVIOR -->
+
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN USAGE -->
+### Usage
+
+Select the vehicle and matching branch manually while offroad, then restart before driving. Later manual ratio changes remain until the next vehicle selection; startup alone does not reapply a vehicle preset.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END USAGE -->
